    "summary": "Snarling Protector allows a 1 CP discount on Heroic Intervention for the Maulerfiend and allows an earlier use in the same phase. Other units can still use it that phase. When the Maulerfiend charges, it can re-roll the Charge roll if an engaged friendly PSYKER is up to 12″ away. By taking the re-roll, it commits to a Charge move ending engaged with a foe that is in combat with that PSYKER.",
